DESCRIPTION:Casey Rocket is an Austin-based comedian risen from the ashes o
 f the speed freaks who came before him.\n\nA southern belle by nature\, Roc
 ket’s comedy career began in the pool halls of South Georgia before his r
 iff-flowers blossomed in the fertile soil of the Atlanta comedy scene.\n\nS
 ince moving to Texas in 2021\, The Crab Man went from living in his Ford Es
 cape to winning the inaugural Austin Comedy Competition. After his stinky l
 ittle victory\, Daft Rocket (as no one calls him) successfully auditioned t
 o join the first class of Door Guys at Joe Rogan’s Comedy Mothership\, wh
 ere he performed alongside some of the biggest names in comedy.\n\nOften no
 ted for his appearances on the Kill Tony podcast\, Rocket was named one of 
 the ‘15 Comedians Ready to Break Out in 2025’ by Deadline.\n\nOver the 
 eons\, Daft Rocket has brought his unique brand of nonsense comedy to SXSW\
 , Moontower\, Skankfest Vegas\, the Boston Comedy Festival\, and many more.
 \n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage 
